WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.738
Welcome to Orbit. Things we have been doing. Our focus is Present Perfect Continuous.

2
00:00:07.738 --> 00:00:18.256
Use have or has been plus the ing form to focus on an activity continuing or repeated up to now. Use the simple form to emphasise completed results.

3
00:00:18.256 --> 00:00:21.665
More volunteers have been joining us lately.

4
00:00:21.665 --> 00:00:24.604
She has been studying since Monday.

5
00:00:24.604 --> 00:00:28.278
We have been preparing the festival for six weeks.

6
00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:37.676
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
